window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Dragon's blood runs hot. Destiny's fire burns hotter.</b></p> <p>Half-dragon, half-witch, and all determination, Stacy Drakethorn has made a name for herself as a peacekeeper among the city's paranormal factions.</p> <p>But when mysterious vampires emerge and people start disappearing, Stacy's delicate balancing act is thrown into chaos. Her werewolf allies are on edge, her father seems suspiciously unconcerned, and an ancient prophecy whispers of impending doom.</p> <p>As tensions rise and factions clash, Stacy is the city's best hope for resolution. But with vampires lurking in shadows and destiny knocking at her door, she'll need more than legal expertise to save the day. From fiery kitchen mishaps to tense standoffs with vampires, Stacy's journey pushes her abilities to the limit.</p> <p>Will Stacy's dragon nature be the key to saving her city, or will it unleash a power she can't control? Can she solve the mystery before the vampires make their move?</p>"; 
